Cracking/etc/shadow Hashes
  /etc/shadow - Linux password hashes are stored = root only

  john command
    john unshadow [path to passwd] [path to shadow]
      unshadow = unshadow tool
      path to passwd = /etc/passwd
      path to shadow = /etc/shadow
    ex. unshadow local_passwd Local_shadow unshadowed.txt
      local_passwd = "/etc/passwd" path
      local_shadow = "/etc/shadow" path

    john --wordlist=/usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt --format=sha512crypt unshadowed.txt
